<title>UK: Morrison Construction in UK building venture.</title>
<headline>Morrison Construction in UK building venture.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Morrison Construction Group Plc said on Wednesday it formed a joint venture with Merlin International Properties Plc to develop a 100 million stg leisure and office complex in Manchester, northwest England.</p>
<p>The two partners will hold 50 percent stakes in the venture, called Morrison Merlin Ltd.</p>
<p>Work on the complex, which will include a 115,000 square foot office building, will begin in November, with completion expected in 2000.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
